With a robe and with basic divination skills, a level 13 monk would be
able to cast identify with 0% failure with WIS as low as 5 (22%
failure at 3, 10% at 4).

In short, practice any divination spell (like light) until you can get
to basic.  #enhance divination skills, keep away from metallic armor,
shields, and "bulky" gloves and you'll be all set!  You did keep your
starting robe, didn't you?

